[2026-03-14T22:30:14.825Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tz9XJZ7PTYGxNtWeGP27V9","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary:\n\n## Complete Analysis: DealsSection Component & explore-deals API\n\n### 1. **DealsSection Component** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.tsx`)\n\n**Fetching Flow:**\n- The component receives `deals`, `loading`, and `originCode` as props from the Redux state\n- In `ExplorePage.tsx`, when an origin airport is selected, `fetchExploreDeals(origin.iata_code)` is dispatched\n- This Redux thunk calls the `/api/explore-deals` endpoint with the origin airport code\n- The response is stored in Redux state (`state.explore.deals` and `state.explore.dealsLoading`)\n\n**Display Logic:**\n- Shows a loading skeleton grid while `loading === true` (4 skeleton cards)\n- Shows \"No deals available from this airport right now\" when empty\n- Displays up to 8 deal cards in a CSS grid layout when deals are available\n- Each card is clickable and navigates to the results page with search parameters\n\n**Data-testid Attributes Used:**\n```\n- deals-section          (main container)\n- deals-loading          (skeleton loading container)\n- deals-empty            (empty state message)\n- deals-grid             (grid container with deal cards)\n- deal-card-{code}       (individual card button, e.g., deal-card-LAX)\n- deal-dates-{code}      (date range text element)\n- deal-price-{code}      (price display element)\n- deal-savings-{code}    (savings percentage element)\n```\n\n**Date Formatting:**\n- Uses `formatDateRange()` function to format dates as \"Mon DD – Mon DD\" format\n- Departure date comes from database, return date is auto-calculated as 7 days later\n\n### 2. **explore-deals Backend Function** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-deals.ts`)\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/explore-deals?origin={originCode}`\n\n**SQL Query Logic:**\nThe function runs a sophisticated CTE (Common Table Expression) query with 2 stages:\n\n**Stage 1 - `route_prices` CTE:**\n- Selects all flights from the origin airport within 90 days\n- Joins: flights → airports (origin/destination) → prices (economy cabin only)\n- Calculates `AVG(total_price_cents)` per destination\n- Uses `ROW_NUMBER()` to rank flights by price (ascending) per destination\n- Selects only the **lowest-priced flight** per destination (WHERE rn = 1)\n\n**Stage 2 - Main SELECT:**\n- Filters to only include deals where `total_price_cents < avg_price_cents` (deals must be below average)\n- Orders results by savings percentage (descending): `(avg_price_cents - total_price_cents) / avg_price_cents`\n- Limits to top 8 deals\n\n**Key Query Features:**\n- Uses window functions (`OVER PARTITION BY`) for efficient aggregation\n- Compares lowest prices against average prices per destination\n- Time range: NOW() to NOW() + 90 days\n\n### 3. **Deal Calculation (Pricing & Savings)**\n\n**Price Calculation:**\n```javascript\nconst price = Math.round(Number(r.total_price_cents) / 100)              // Converts cents to dollars\nconst avgPrice = Math.round(Number(r.avg_price_cents) / 100)              // Average price in dollars\n```\n\n**Savings Percent Calculation:**\n```javascript\nconst savingsPercent = avgPrice > 0 ? Math.round(((avgPrice - price) / avgPrice) * 100) : 0\n```\n\nFormula: `(average_price - lowest_price) / average_price * 100`\n\n**Deal Properties Returned:**\n```typescript\n{\n  id: string                    // Destination airport ID\n  destination_code: string      // IATA code (e.g., \"LAX\")\n  destination_city: string      // City name\n  destination_country: string   // Country name\n  departure_date: string        // YYYY-MM-DD format\n  return_date: string           // YYYY-MM-DD (departure_date + 7 days)\n  price: number                 // Lowest fare in dollars\n  average_price: number         // Average fare in dollars\n  savings_percent: number       // Percentage savings (0-100)\n  gradient: string              // CSS gradient background (8 alternating gradients)\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Integration Flow**\n\n1. User selects origin airport in ExplorePage\n2. `fetchExploreDeals()` Redux thunk is triggered\n3. Calls `/api/explore-deals?origin={code}`\n4. explore-deals function queries database for best deals\n5. Returns array of up to 8 deals sorted by savings percentage\n6. Redux updates `state.explore.deals` and `state.explore.dealsLoading`\n7. DealsSection component renders with updated deals\n8. User clicks a deal card → navigates to `/results?origin={code}&destination={code}&departureDate={date}&returnDate={date}`\n\n---\n\n## Complete File Contents\n\n### File 1: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.tsx`\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom'\nimport type { Deal } from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport './DealsSection.css'\n\ninterface DealsSectionProps {\n  deals: Deal[]\n  loading: boolean\n  originCode: string | null\n}\n\nfunction formatDateRange(dep: string, ret: string): string {\n  const d = new Date(dep + 'T12:00:00')\n  const r = new Date(ret + 'T12:00:00')\n  const depStr = d.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })\n  const retStr = r.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })\n  return `${depStr} – ${retStr}`\n}\n\nfunction DealsSection({ deals, loading, originCode }: DealsSectionProps) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  function handleDealClick(deal: Deal) {\n    const params = new URLSearchParams({\n      origin: originCode || '',\n      destination: deal.destination_code,\n      departureDate: deal.departure_date,\n      returnDate: deal.return_date,\n    })\n    navigate(`/results?${params.toString()}`)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"deals-section\" data-testid=\"deals-section\">\n      <h3 className=\"deals-section__title\">Deals</h3>\n\n      {loading ? (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__loading\" data-testid=\"deals-loading\">\n          <div className=\"deals-section__skeleton-grid\">\n            {[1, 2, 3, 4].map((i) => (\n              <div key={i} className=\"deals-section__skeleton-card\" />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ) : deals.length === 0 ? (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__empty\" data-testid=\"deals-empty\">\n          No deals available from this airport right now\n        </div>\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__grid\" data-testid=\"deals-grid\">\n          {deals.map((deal) => (\n            <button\n              key={`${deal.id}-${deal.departure_date}`}\n              className=\"deals-section__card\"\n              onClick={() => handleDealClick(deal)}\n              data-testid={`deal-card-${deal.destination_code}`}\n            >\n              <div\n                className=\"deals-section__card-image\"\n                style={{ background: deal.gradient }}\n              >\n                <span className=\"deals-section__card-code\">{deal.destination_code}</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"deals-section__card-body\">\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-destination\">\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-city\">{deal.destination_city}</span>\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-country\">{deal.destination_country}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-dates\" data-testid={`deal-dates-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                  {formatDateRange(deal.departure_date, deal.return_date)}\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-pricing\">\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-price\" data-testid={`deal-price-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                    ${deal.price}\n                  </span>\n                  {deal.savings_percent > 0 && (\n                    <span className=\"deals-section__card-savings\" data-testid={`deal-savings-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                      ↓ {deal.savings_percent}% less than usual\n                    </span>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default DealsSection\n```\n\n### File 2: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.css`\n```css\n.deals-section {\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--color-shadow);\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__title {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n  overflow: visible;\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  text-align: left;\n  transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow-hover);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-image {\n  height: 100px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-code {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: white;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-body {\n  padding: 12px 16px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-destination {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-city {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-country {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-dates {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-pricing {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-price {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-savings {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--color-success);\n}\n\n.deals-section__loading {\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.deals-section__skeleton-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__skeleton-card {\n  height: 200px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: var(--color-border-light);\n  animation: deals-pulse 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes deals-pulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n}\n\n.deals-section__empty {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 40px 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n```\n\n### File 3: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-deals.ts`\n```typescript\nimport type { Context } from '@netlify/functions'\nimport { getSql } from './db.js'\n\nconst gradients = [\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b 0%, #38f9d7 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #a18cd1 0%, #fbc2eb 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #fccb90 0%, #d57eeb 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #e0c3fc 0%, #8ec5fc 100%)',\n]\n\nexport default async (request: Request, _context: Context) => {\n  const url = new URL(request.url)\n  const originCode = url.searchParams.get('origin')\n\n  if (!originCode) {\n    return Response.json({ error: 'origin is required' }, { status: 400 })\n  }\n\n  const sql = getSql()\n\n  // Find flights with lowest prices from this origin, and compute average for comparison\n  const results = await sql`\n    WITH route_prices AS (\n      SELECT\n        da.id as dest_id,\n        da.iata_code as destination_code,\n        da.city as destination_city,\n        da.country as destination_country,\n        f.id as flight_id,\n        DATE(f.departure_time) as departure_date,\n        p.total_price_cents,\n        AVG(p.total_price_cents) OVER (PARTITION BY da.id) as avg_price_cents,\n        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY da.id ORDER BY p.total_price_cents ASC) as rn\n      FROM flights f\n      JOIN airports oa ON f.origin_airport_id = oa.id\n      JOIN airports da ON f.destination_airport_id = da.id\n      JOIN prices p ON p.flight_id = f.id AND p.cabin_class = 'economy'\n      WHERE oa.iata_code = ${originCode}\n        AND f.departure_time > NOW()\n        AND f.departure_time < NOW() + INTERVAL '90 days'\n    )\n    SELECT\n      dest_id,\n      destination_code,\n      destination_city,\n      destination_country,\n      departure_date,\n      total_price_cents,\n      avg_price_cents\n    FROM route_prices\n    WHERE rn = 1\n      AND total_price_cents < avg_price_cents\n    ORDER BY (avg_price_cents - total_price_cents)::float / NULLIF(avg_price_cents, 0) DESC\n    LIMIT 8\n  `\n\n  const deals = results.map((r, i) => {\n    const price = Math.round(Number(r.total_price_cents) / 100)\n    const avgPrice = Math.round(Number(r.avg_price_cents) / 100)\n    const savingsPercent = avgPrice > 0 ? Math.round(((avgPrice - price) / avgPrice) * 100) : 0\n    const depDate = String(r.departure_date).split('T')[0]!\n\n    // Compute return date (1 week later)\n    const returnDate = new Date(depDate + 'T12:00:00')\n    returnDate.setDate(returnDate.getDate() + 7)\n    const retStr = returnDate.toISOString().split('T')[0]\n\n    return {\n      id: r.dest_id,\n      destination_code: r.destination_code,\n      destination_city: r.destination_city,\n      destination_country: r.destination_country,\n      departure_date: depDate,\n      return_date: retStr,\n      price,\n      average_price: avgPrice,\n      savings_percent: savingsPercent,\n      gradient: gradients[i % gradients.length]!,\n    }\n  })\n\n  return Response.json(deals)\n}\n```\n\n### File 4: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/exploreSlice.ts`\n```typescript\nimport { createSlice, createAsyncThunk, type PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit'\nimport type { Airport } from './searchSlice'\n\nexport interface ExploreDestination {\n  id: string\n  iata_code: string\n  city: string\n  country: string\n  latitude: number\n  longitude: number\n  lowest_price: number\n  airline_name: string\n}\n\nexport interface DatePrice {\n  date: string\n  price: number | null\n}\n\nexport interface Deal {\n  id: string\n  destination_code: string\n  destination_city: string\n  destination_country: string\n  departure_date: string\n  return_date: string\n  price: number\n  average_price: number\n  savings_percent: number\n  gradient: string\n}\n\nexport type DateRange = 'weekend' | '1week' | '2weeks'\n\ninterface ExploreState {\n  origin: Airport | null\n  destinations: ExploreDestination[]\n  destinationsLoading: boolean\n  datePrices: DatePrice[]\n  datePricesLoading: boolean\n  dateRange: DateRange\n  deals: Deal[]\n  dealsLoading: boolean\n}\n\nconst initialState: ExploreState = {\n  origin: null,\n  destinations: [],\n  destinationsLoading: false,\n  datePrices: [],\n  datePricesLoading: false,\n  dateRange: 'weekend',\n  deals: [],\n  dealsLoading: false,\n}\n\nexport const fetchExploreDestinations = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDestinations',\n  async (originCode: string) => {\n    const res = await fetch(`/api/explore-destinations?origin=${encodeURIComponent(originCode)}`)\n    return res.json() as Promise<ExploreDestination[]>\n  }\n)\n\nexport const fetchExploreDates = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDates',\n  async (params: { originCode: string; dateRange: DateRange }) => {\n    const res = await fetch(\n      `/api/explore-dates?origin=${encodeURIComponent(params.originCode)}&range=${params.dateRange}`\n    )\n    return res.json() as Promise<DatePrice[]>\n  }\n)\n\nexport const fetchExploreDeals = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDeals',\n  async (originCode: string) => {\n    const res = await fetch(`/api/explore-deals?origin=${encodeURIComponent(originCode)}`)\n    return res.json() as Promise<Deal[]>\n  }\n)\n\nconst exploreSlice = createSlice({\n  name: 'explore',\n  initialState,\n  reducers: {\n    setExploreOrigin(state, action: PayloadAction<Airport | null>) {\n      state.origin = action.payload\n    },\n    setDateRange(state, action: PayloadAction<DateRange>) {\n      state.dateRange = action.payload\n    },\n  },\n  extraReducers: (builder) => {\n    builder\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.pending, (state) => {\n        state.destinationsLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.destinations = action.payload\n        state.destinationsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.destinationsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.pending, (state) => {\n        state.datePricesLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.datePrices = action.payload\n        state.datePricesLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.datePricesLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.pending, (state) => {\n        state.dealsLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.deals = action.payload\n        state.dealsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.dealsLoading = false\n      })\n  },\n})\n\nexport const { setExploreOrigin, setDateRange } = exploreSlice.actions\nexport default exploreSlice.reducer\n```\n\n### File 5: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/ExplorePage.tsx`\n```typescript\nimport { useEffect, useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useDispatch, useSelector } from 'react-redux'\nimport {\n  setExploreOrigin,\n  setDateRange,\n  fetchExploreDestinations,\n  fetchExploreDates,\n  fetchExploreDeals,\n} from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport type { DateRange } from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport type { Airport } from '../slices/searchSlice'\nimport type { RootState, AppDispatch } from '../store'\nimport AirportAutocomplete from '../components/AirportAutocomplete'\nimport DestinationMap from '../components/DestinationMap'\nimport FlexibleDatesGrid from '../components/FlexibleDatesGrid'\nimport DealsSection from '../components/DealsSection'\nimport './ExplorePage.css'\n\nfunction ExplorePage() {\n  const dispatch = useDispatch<AppDispatch>()\n  const {\n    origin,\n    destinations,\n    destinationsLoading,\n    datePrices,\n    datePricesLoading,\n    dateRange,\n    deals,\n    dealsLoading,\n  } = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.explore)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!origin) return\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDestinations(origin.iata_code))\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDeals(origin.iata_code))\n  }, [dispatch, origin])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!origin) return\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDates({ originCode: origin.iata_code, dateRange }))\n  }, [dispatch, origin, dateRange])\n\n  const handleOriginChange = useCallback((airport: Airport | null) => {\n    dispatch(setExploreOrigin(airport))\n  }, [dispatch])\n\n  const handleDateRangeChange = useCallback((range: DateRange) => {\n    dispatch(setDateRange(range))\n  }, [dispatch])\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"explore-page\" data-testid=\"explore-page\">\n      <div className=\"explore-page__header\">\n        <h1 className=\"explore-page__title\">Explore destinations</h1>\n        <p className=\"explore-page__subtitle\">Find cheap flights from your airport</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"explore-page__origin-selector\" data-testid=\"explore-origin-selector\">\n        <label className=\"explore-page__origin-label\">From</label>\n        <AirportAutocomplete\n          value={origin}\n          onChange={handleOriginChange}\n          placeholder=\"Select origin airport\"\n          testIdPrefix=\"explore-origin\"\n        />\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"explore-page__sections\">\n        <section className=\"explore-page__map-section\">\n          <DestinationMap\n            destinations={destinations}\n            loading={destinationsLoading}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n\n        <section className=\"explore-page__dates-section\">\n          <FlexibleDatesGrid\n            datePrices={datePrices}\n            loading={datePricesLoading}\n            dateRange={dateRange}\n            onDateRangeChange={handleDateRangeChange}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n\n        <section className=\"explore-page__deals-section\">\n          <DealsSection\n            deals={deals}\n            loading={dealsLoading}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default ExplorePage\n```"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aeef4497543a9ad27 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 35329\ntool_uses: 12\nduration_ms: 44711</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"630917b2-6ea2-4867-b126-d32adb3e5b74","uuid":"6258f5b5-2a92-4c05-8f84-379be1d10f79","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/GoogleFlights, find the DealsSection component and the explore-deals API function. I need to understand:\n1. How the DealsSection component fetches and displays deals\n2. What data-testid attributes it uses (deal-card-*, deal-dates-*, deal-price-*, deal-savings-*, deals-section, deals-grid, deals-loading, deals-empty)\n3. The explore-deals backend function and what SQL query it runs\n4. How deals are calculated (pricing/savings)\n\nRead all relevant files and provide the full content of each file.","agentId":"aeef4497543a9ad27","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary:\n\n## Complete Analysis: DealsSection Component & explore-deals API\n\n### 1. **DealsSection Component** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.tsx`)\n\n**Fetching Flow:**\n- The component receives `deals`, `loading`, and `originCode` as props from the Redux state\n- In `ExplorePage.tsx`, when an origin airport is selected, `fetchExploreDeals(origin.iata_code)` is dispatched\n- This Redux thunk calls the `/api/explore-deals` endpoint with the origin airport code\n- The response is stored in Redux state (`state.explore.deals` and `state.explore.dealsLoading`)\n\n**Display Logic:**\n- Shows a loading skeleton grid while `loading === true` (4 skeleton cards)\n- Shows \"No deals available from this airport right now\" when empty\n- Displays up to 8 deal cards in a CSS grid layout when deals are available\n- Each card is clickable and navigates to the results page with search parameters\n\n**Data-testid Attributes Used:**\n```\n- deals-section          (main container)\n- deals-loading          (skeleton loading container)\n- deals-empty            (empty state message)\n- deals-grid             (grid container with deal cards)\n- deal-card-{code}       (individual card button, e.g., deal-card-LAX)\n- deal-dates-{code}      (date range text element)\n- deal-price-{code}      (price display element)\n- deal-savings-{code}    (savings percentage element)\n```\n\n**Date Formatting:**\n- Uses `formatDateRange()` function to format dates as \"Mon DD – Mon DD\" format\n- Departure date comes from database, return date is auto-calculated as 7 days later\n\n### 2. **explore-deals Backend Function** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-deals.ts`)\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/explore-deals?origin={originCode}`\n\n**SQL Query Logic:**\nThe function runs a sophisticated CTE (Common Table Expression) query with 2 stages:\n\n**Stage 1 - `route_prices` CTE:**\n- Selects all flights from the origin airport within 90 days\n- Joins: flights → airports (origin/destination) → prices (economy cabin only)\n- Calculates `AVG(total_price_cents)` per destination\n- Uses `ROW_NUMBER()` to rank flights by price (ascending) per destination\n- Selects only the **lowest-priced flight** per destination (WHERE rn = 1)\n\n**Stage 2 - Main SELECT:**\n- Filters to only include deals where `total_price_cents < avg_price_cents` (deals must be below average)\n- Orders results by savings percentage (descending): `(avg_price_cents - total_price_cents) / avg_price_cents`\n- Limits to top 8 deals\n\n**Key Query Features:**\n- Uses window functions (`OVER PARTITION BY`) for efficient aggregation\n- Compares lowest prices against average prices per destination\n- Time range: NOW() to NOW() + 90 days\n\n### 3. **Deal Calculation (Pricing & Savings)**\n\n**Price Calculation:**\n```javascript\nconst price = Math.round(Number(r.total_price_cents) / 100)              // Converts cents to dollars\nconst avgPrice = Math.round(Number(r.avg_price_cents) / 100)              // Average price in dollars\n```\n\n**Savings Percent Calculation:**\n```javascript\nconst savingsPercent = avgPrice > 0 ? Math.round(((avgPrice - price) / avgPrice) * 100) : 0\n```\n\nFormula: `(average_price - lowest_price) / average_price * 100`\n\n**Deal Properties Returned:**\n```typescript\n{\n  id: string                    // Destination airport ID\n  destination_code: string      // IATA code (e.g., \"LAX\")\n  destination_city: string      // City name\n  destination_country: string   // Country name\n  departure_date: string        // YYYY-MM-DD format\n  return_date: string           // YYYY-MM-DD (departure_date + 7 days)\n  price: number                 // Lowest fare in dollars\n  average_price: number         // Average fare in dollars\n  savings_percent: number       // Percentage savings (0-100)\n  gradient: string              // CSS gradient background (8 alternating gradients)\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Integration Flow**\n\n1. User selects origin airport in ExplorePage\n2. `fetchExploreDeals()` Redux thunk is triggered\n3. Calls `/api/explore-deals?origin={code}`\n4. explore-deals function queries database for best deals\n5. Returns array of up to 8 deals sorted by savings percentage\n6. Redux updates `state.explore.deals` and `state.explore.dealsLoading`\n7. DealsSection component renders with updated deals\n8. User clicks a deal card → navigates to `/results?origin={code}&destination={code}&departureDate={date}&returnDate={date}`\n\n---\n\n## Complete File Contents\n\n### File 1: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.tsx`\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom'\nimport type { Deal } from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport './DealsSection.css'\n\ninterface DealsSectionProps {\n  deals: Deal[]\n  loading: boolean\n  originCode: string | null\n}\n\nfunction formatDateRange(dep: string, ret: string): string {\n  const d = new Date(dep + 'T12:00:00')\n  const r = new Date(ret + 'T12:00:00')\n  const depStr = d.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })\n  const retStr = r.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })\n  return `${depStr} – ${retStr}`\n}\n\nfunction DealsSection({ deals, loading, originCode }: DealsSectionProps) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  function handleDealClick(deal: Deal) {\n    const params = new URLSearchParams({\n      origin: originCode || '',\n      destination: deal.destination_code,\n      departureDate: deal.departure_date,\n      returnDate: deal.return_date,\n    })\n    navigate(`/results?${params.toString()}`)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"deals-section\" data-testid=\"deals-section\">\n      <h3 className=\"deals-section__title\">Deals</h3>\n\n      {loading ? (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__loading\" data-testid=\"deals-loading\">\n          <div className=\"deals-section__skeleton-grid\">\n            {[1, 2, 3, 4].map((i) => (\n              <div key={i} className=\"deals-section__skeleton-card\" />\n            ))}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ) : deals.length === 0 ? (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__empty\" data-testid=\"deals-empty\">\n          No deals available from this airport right now\n        </div>\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"deals-section__grid\" data-testid=\"deals-grid\">\n          {deals.map((deal) => (\n            <button\n              key={`${deal.id}-${deal.departure_date}`}\n              className=\"deals-section__card\"\n              onClick={() => handleDealClick(deal)}\n              data-testid={`deal-card-${deal.destination_code}`}\n            >\n              <div\n                className=\"deals-section__card-image\"\n                style={{ background: deal.gradient }}\n              >\n                <span className=\"deals-section__card-code\">{deal.destination_code}</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"deals-section__card-body\">\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-destination\">\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-city\">{deal.destination_city}</span>\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-country\">{deal.destination_country}</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-dates\" data-testid={`deal-dates-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                  {formatDateRange(deal.departure_date, deal.return_date)}\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"deals-section__card-pricing\">\n                  <span className=\"deals-section__card-price\" data-testid={`deal-price-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                    ${deal.price}\n                  </span>\n                  {deal.savings_percent > 0 && (\n                    <span className=\"deals-section__card-savings\" data-testid={`deal-savings-${deal.destination_code}`}>\n                      ↓ {deal.savings_percent}% less than usual\n                    </span>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default DealsSection\n```\n\n### File 2: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DealsSection.css`\n```css\n.deals-section {\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--color-shadow);\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__title {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n  overflow: visible;\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  text-align: left;\n  transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--color-shadow-hover);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-image {\n  height: 100px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-code {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: white;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-body {\n  padding: 12px 16px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-destination {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-city {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-country {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-dates {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-pricing {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-price {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-primary);\n}\n\n.deals-section__card-savings {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--color-success);\n}\n\n.deals-section__loading {\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.deals-section__skeleton-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.deals-section__skeleton-card {\n  height: 200px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: var(--color-border-light);\n  animation: deals-pulse 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes deals-pulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n}\n\n.deals-section__empty {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 40px 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n}\n```\n\n### File 3: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/explore-deals.ts`\n```typescript\nimport type { Context } from '@netlify/functions'\nimport { getSql } from './db.js'\n\nconst gradients = [\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b 0%, #38f9d7 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #a18cd1 0%, #fbc2eb 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #fccb90 0%, #d57eeb 100%)',\n  'linear-gradient(135deg, #e0c3fc 0%, #8ec5fc 100%)',\n]\n\nexport default async (request: Request, _context: Context) => {\n  const url = new URL(request.url)\n  const originCode = url.searchParams.get('origin')\n\n  if (!originCode) {\n    return Response.json({ error: 'origin is required' }, { status: 400 })\n  }\n\n  const sql = getSql()\n\n  // Find flights with lowest prices from this origin, and compute average for comparison\n  const results = await sql`\n    WITH route_prices AS (\n      SELECT\n        da.id as dest_id,\n        da.iata_code as destination_code,\n        da.city as destination_city,\n        da.country as destination_country,\n        f.id as flight_id,\n        DATE(f.departure_time) as departure_date,\n        p.total_price_cents,\n        AVG(p.total_price_cents) OVER (PARTITION BY da.id) as avg_price_cents,\n        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY da.id ORDER BY p.total_price_cents ASC) as rn\n      FROM flights f\n      JOIN airports oa ON f.origin_airport_id = oa.id\n      JOIN airports da ON f.destination_airport_id = da.id\n      JOIN prices p ON p.flight_id = f.id AND p.cabin_class = 'economy'\n      WHERE oa.iata_code = ${originCode}\n        AND f.departure_time > NOW()\n        AND f.departure_time < NOW() + INTERVAL '90 days'\n    )\n    SELECT\n      dest_id,\n      destination_code,\n      destination_city,\n      destination_country,\n      departure_date,\n      total_price_cents,\n      avg_price_cents\n    FROM route_prices\n    WHERE rn = 1\n      AND total_price_cents < avg_price_cents\n    ORDER BY (avg_price_cents - total_price_cents)::float / NULLIF(avg_price_cents, 0) DESC\n    LIMIT 8\n  `\n\n  const deals = results.map((r, i) => {\n    const price = Math.round(Number(r.total_price_cents) / 100)\n    const avgPrice = Math.round(Number(r.avg_price_cents) / 100)\n    const savingsPercent = avgPrice > 0 ? Math.round(((avgPrice - price) / avgPrice) * 100) : 0\n    const depDate = String(r.departure_date).split('T')[0]!\n\n    // Compute return date (1 week later)\n    const returnDate = new Date(depDate + 'T12:00:00')\n    returnDate.setDate(returnDate.getDate() + 7)\n    const retStr = returnDate.toISOString().split('T')[0]\n\n    return {\n      id: r.dest_id,\n      destination_code: r.destination_code,\n      destination_city: r.destination_city,\n      destination_country: r.destination_country,\n      departure_date: depDate,\n      return_date: retStr,\n      price,\n      average_price: avgPrice,\n      savings_percent: savingsPercent,\n      gradient: gradients[i % gradients.length]!,\n    }\n  })\n\n  return Response.json(deals)\n}\n```\n\n### File 4: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/exploreSlice.ts`\n```typescript\nimport { createSlice, createAsyncThunk, type PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit'\nimport type { Airport } from './searchSlice'\n\nexport interface ExploreDestination {\n  id: string\n  iata_code: string\n  city: string\n  country: string\n  latitude: number\n  longitude: number\n  lowest_price: number\n  airline_name: string\n}\n\nexport interface DatePrice {\n  date: string\n  price: number | null\n}\n\nexport interface Deal {\n  id: string\n  destination_code: string\n  destination_city: string\n  destination_country: string\n  departure_date: string\n  return_date: string\n  price: number\n  average_price: number\n  savings_percent: number\n  gradient: string\n}\n\nexport type DateRange = 'weekend' | '1week' | '2weeks'\n\ninterface ExploreState {\n  origin: Airport | null\n  destinations: ExploreDestination[]\n  destinationsLoading: boolean\n  datePrices: DatePrice[]\n  datePricesLoading: boolean\n  dateRange: DateRange\n  deals: Deal[]\n  dealsLoading: boolean\n}\n\nconst initialState: ExploreState = {\n  origin: null,\n  destinations: [],\n  destinationsLoading: false,\n  datePrices: [],\n  datePricesLoading: false,\n  dateRange: 'weekend',\n  deals: [],\n  dealsLoading: false,\n}\n\nexport const fetchExploreDestinations = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDestinations',\n  async (originCode: string) => {\n    const res = await fetch(`/api/explore-destinations?origin=${encodeURIComponent(originCode)}`)\n    return res.json() as Promise<ExploreDestination[]>\n  }\n)\n\nexport const fetchExploreDates = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDates',\n  async (params: { originCode: string; dateRange: DateRange }) => {\n    const res = await fetch(\n      `/api/explore-dates?origin=${encodeURIComponent(params.originCode)}&range=${params.dateRange}`\n    )\n    return res.json() as Promise<DatePrice[]>\n  }\n)\n\nexport const fetchExploreDeals = createAsyncThunk(\n  'explore/fetchDeals',\n  async (originCode: string) => {\n    const res = await fetch(`/api/explore-deals?origin=${encodeURIComponent(originCode)}`)\n    return res.json() as Promise<Deal[]>\n  }\n)\n\nconst exploreSlice = createSlice({\n  name: 'explore',\n  initialState,\n  reducers: {\n    setExploreOrigin(state, action: PayloadAction<Airport | null>) {\n      state.origin = action.payload\n    },\n    setDateRange(state, action: PayloadAction<DateRange>) {\n      state.dateRange = action.payload\n    },\n  },\n  extraReducers: (builder) => {\n    builder\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.pending, (state) => {\n        state.destinationsLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.destinations = action.payload\n        state.destinationsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDestinations.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.destinationsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.pending, (state) => {\n        state.datePricesLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.datePrices = action.payload\n        state.datePricesLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDates.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.datePricesLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.pending, (state) => {\n        state.dealsLoading = true\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n        state.deals = action.payload\n        state.dealsLoading = false\n      })\n      .addCase(fetchExploreDeals.rejected, (state) => {\n        state.dealsLoading = false\n      })\n  },\n})\n\nexport const { setExploreOrigin, setDateRange } = exploreSlice.actions\nexport default exploreSlice.reducer\n```\n\n### File 5: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/ExplorePage.tsx`\n```typescript\nimport { useEffect, useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useDispatch, useSelector } from 'react-redux'\nimport {\n  setExploreOrigin,\n  setDateRange,\n  fetchExploreDestinations,\n  fetchExploreDates,\n  fetchExploreDeals,\n} from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport type { DateRange } from '../slices/exploreSlice'\nimport type { Airport } from '../slices/searchSlice'\nimport type { RootState, AppDispatch } from '../store'\nimport AirportAutocomplete from '../components/AirportAutocomplete'\nimport DestinationMap from '../components/DestinationMap'\nimport FlexibleDatesGrid from '../components/FlexibleDatesGrid'\nimport DealsSection from '../components/DealsSection'\nimport './ExplorePage.css'\n\nfunction ExplorePage() {\n  const dispatch = useDispatch<AppDispatch>()\n  const {\n    origin,\n    destinations,\n    destinationsLoading,\n    datePrices,\n    datePricesLoading,\n    dateRange,\n    deals,\n    dealsLoading,\n  } = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.explore)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!origin) return\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDestinations(origin.iata_code))\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDeals(origin.iata_code))\n  }, [dispatch, origin])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!origin) return\n    dispatch(fetchExploreDates({ originCode: origin.iata_code, dateRange }))\n  }, [dispatch, origin, dateRange])\n\n  const handleOriginChange = useCallback((airport: Airport | null) => {\n    dispatch(setExploreOrigin(airport))\n  }, [dispatch])\n\n  const handleDateRangeChange = useCallback((range: DateRange) => {\n    dispatch(setDateRange(range))\n  }, [dispatch])\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"explore-page\" data-testid=\"explore-page\">\n      <div className=\"explore-page__header\">\n        <h1 className=\"explore-page__title\">Explore destinations</h1>\n        <p className=\"explore-page__subtitle\">Find cheap flights from your airport</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"explore-page__origin-selector\" data-testid=\"explore-origin-selector\">\n        <label className=\"explore-page__origin-label\">From</label>\n        <AirportAutocomplete\n          value={origin}\n          onChange={handleOriginChange}\n          placeholder=\"Select origin airport\"\n          testIdPrefix=\"explore-origin\"\n        />\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"explore-page__sections\">\n        <section className=\"explore-page__map-section\">\n          <DestinationMap\n            destinations={destinations}\n            loading={destinationsLoading}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n\n        <section className=\"explore-page__dates-section\">\n          <FlexibleDatesGrid\n            datePrices={datePrices}\n            loading={datePricesLoading}\n            dateRange={dateRange}\n            onDateRangeChange={handleDateRangeChange}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n\n        <section className=\"explore-page__deals-section\">\n          <DealsSection\n            deals={deals}\n            loading={dealsLoading}\n            originCode={origin?.iata_code || null}\n          />\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default ExplorePage\n```"}],"totalDurationMs":44711,"totalTokens":35329,"totalToolUseCount":12,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1327,"cache_read_input_tokens":27571,"output_tokens":6428,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard